id: vaapi_codec
category_id: va-api
plugin: resource
user: root
environ: VAAPI_DEVICE LIBVA_DRIVER_NAME
_summary:
    Report the VA-API profiles and entrypoints supported by the render node
command:
    vaapi_codec_resource.py
_description:
    Emits one record per VA-API (profile, entrypoint) pair reported by
    vainfo on the DRM render node, with numeric ids matching the VAProfile
    and VAEntrypoint enums. The ffmpeg codec jobs use this to skip codecs
    the platform cannot accelerate instead of failing on them.
